        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✣ <strong>Dread Chess</strong> is an original and strange narrative story-puzzle game that you can play as a chess sandbox by setting asymmetric rules for the players, or explore it in search of different endings and achievments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative:</strong> Multiple endings based on your successes, failures, and the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Rules Sandbox:</strong> Design unfair advantages or crippling handicaps—then see them in action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Option to use Latin as main Language: &quot;</strong>Mortales ludunt, dii rident&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere:</strong> Gothic pixel art, unsettling soundscapes, and a story that lingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Playing Chess:</strong> Observe autonomous matches that reveal hidden truths and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode:</strong> Sit back and watch the AI duel itself, or share the spectacle online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the <strong>God of Madness</strong> as it poses three life-or-death riddles—discover the answers by watching enchanted, self-playing chess matches unfold. Each choice echoes through a richly decorated, gothic pixel-art world, leading you toward one of several hauntingly endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.poster.avif?t=1787587985\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.webm?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.mp4?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong><br>Unleash your creativity in a versatile sandbox environment. Customize asymmetric rule sets and go head-to-head against the AI—or a friend—in a variety of modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Mode:</strong> Choose from three thematic options (bad, average, good) for each move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tarot Cards</strong>: Global conditions that change the rules of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Mode:</strong> Roll the die to determine which chess piece you must move—luck may be on your side, or it may betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong>: Pure, classic chess with direct control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.poster.avif?t=1787587985\" width=714 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.webm?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.mp4?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dread Chess</strong> and decide for yourself: can you outwit the God of Madness?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✣ <strong>Dread Chess</strong> is an original and strange narrative story-puzzle game that you can play as a chess sandbox by setting asymmetric rules for the players, or explore it in search of different endings and achievments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative:</strong> Multiple endings based on your successes, failures, and the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Rules Sandbox:</strong> Design unfair advantages or crippling handicaps—then see them in action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Option to use Latin as main Language: &quot;</strong>Mortales ludunt, dii rident&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere:</strong> Gothic pixel art, unsettling soundscapes, and a story that lingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Playing Chess:</strong> Observe autonomous matches that reveal hidden truths and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator Mode:</strong> Sit back and watch the AI duel itself, or share the spectacle online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the <strong>God of Madness</strong> as it poses three life-or-death riddles—discover the answers by watching enchanted, self-playing chess matches unfold. Each choice echoes through a richly decorated, gothic pixel-art world, leading you toward one of several hauntingly endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.poster.avif?t=1787587985\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.webm?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/b7b870ff8e0f555bc31c06bafb1e3060.mp4?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong><br>Unleash your creativity in a versatile sandbox environment. Customize asymmetric rule sets and go head-to-head against the AI—or a friend—in a variety of modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Mode:</strong> Choose from three thematic options (bad, average, good) for each move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tarot Cards</strong>: Global conditions that change the rules of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Mode:</strong> Roll the die to determine which chess piece you must move—luck may be on your side, or it may betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong>: Pure, classic chess with direct control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.poster.avif?t=1787587985\" width=714 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.webm?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582640/extras/9ecc382eebf3434f2914bed7fa12d628.mp4?t=1787587985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dread Chess</strong> and decide for yourself: can you outwit the God of Madness?</p>",
        "short_description": "Dread Chess est un jeu original et étrange mêlant histoire narrative, puzzles et éléments de sandbox. Découvrez les mystères en parlant aux dieux en latin. Plongez dans une atmosphère de folie et atteignez l’une des nombreuses fins d’une partie injuste contre la Mort, qui ne peut être jouée qu’UNE SEULE FOIS...",
